# sysid_thrust_dob.expect — the multisine with the DOB enabled: the excitation is not cancelled as a disturbance
# sysid_thrust_dob.expect — DOB を有効にした多重正弦波: 励振は外乱として打ち消されない
#
# Same pass lines as sysid_thrust_multisine (fixed before the run): the DOB model is fed the command including the excitation, so the signal stays on the record
# and the height stays within +-0.15 m. tests/test_thrust_excitation_bundles.py compares the vertical acceleration with the DOB-off flight.
# sysid_thrust_multisine と同じ合格の線（実行の前に決めた）: DOB のモデルには励振を含む指令を与えるので、信号は記録に残り、高さは ±0.15 m 以内。
# tests/test_thrust_excitation_bundles.py が鉛直の加速度を DOB 無効の飛行と比べる。
exit 0
log_contains any "Thrust excitation end: result=2 reason=0 (none)"
log_absent  any "excitation aborted"
metric alt_band < 0.30 in 27.0 46.5
metric alt_min > 0.55 in 27.0 46.5
metric tilt_max < 0.1745 in 26.0 47.0
metric duty_max < 0.92 in 26.0 47.0
bundle_value ctrl_ref.thrust_excitation_state max >= 12
bundle_value ctrl_output.thrust max > 0.3527 in 30.0 44.0
bundle_value ctrl_output.thrust min < 0.3355 in 30.0 44.0
metric alt_max < 0.10 in 56.0 57.9
